~ call_with_wendy
do _prevent_end_call_while_dialog_is_not_finished()
Danilo: ...?
Wendy: Dan, are you sure you want to reschedule your appointment now?
Danilo: Yes, sorry, I had to go home suddenly.
Wendy: I know, I called Tita Mira since you weren’t replying.
Wendy: Luckily, she told me.
Danilo: How are you, Wen?
Wendy: I’m good, Dan.
Wendy: Honestly, I wish you had at least texted me.
Wendy: I was worried...
Wendy: ...
Wendy: Were you stuck in traffic? How was the province visit?
Danilo: I just arrived.
Danilo: I even saw Lola Ising.
Danilo: She’s still waiting for the souvenir from you.
Wendy: Geez, Lola. She always wants to send me home. Did she say anything else?
Danilo: She told me to avoid the forest... [shake]Because of [color=#8B0000][i]Mateo[/i][/color].[/shake]
Wendy: Take your meds, Tita said yours are running out.
Danilo: I’ll go to town tomorrow to buy some.
Wendy: Good. When will you return?
Danilo: My leave is 1 week, but I might come back earlier.
Wendy: You deserve the break. [wave]Call me if you need anything, okay?[/wave]
Danilo: Will do. Thanks.
do replied_to_wendy = true
do call_with_wendy_done = true
do SignalBus.call_done.emit()
do reply_finish.emit()
do _prevent_end_call_while_dialog_is_not_finished()
do _prevent_chat_exit_while_dialoging()
=> END

